{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++ code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++ code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nstruct Fraction\n{\n    long long num;\n    long long den;\n};\n\nvoid reduce(Fraction &f)\n{\n    long long greater = f.num > f.den ? f.num : f.den;\n    long long smaller = f.num > f.den ? f.den : f.num;\n\n    if (smaller == 0)\n    {\n        greater = 1;\n        return;\n    }\n\n    long long remainder;\n    while (smaller != 0)\n    {\n        remainder = greater % smaller;\n        greater = smaller;\n        smaller = remainder;\n    }\n\n    f.num /= greater;\n    f.den /= greater;\n}\n\nint main()\n{\n    long long x, y, limit;\n    while (cin >> x >> y >> limit)\n    {\n        Fraction ans;\n\n        if (y <= limit)\n        {\n            ans.num = x;\n            ans.den = y;\n        }\n        else\n        {\n            float best = 1.0f;\n            float err;\n\n            for (long long i = 1; i <= limit; i++)\n            {\n                long long k = i * x / y;\n\n                err = (float)((double)x / (double)y - (double)k / (double)i);\n                if (err < best)\n                {\n                    best = err;\n                    ans.num = k;\n                    ans.den = i;\n                }\n\n                err = (float)((double)(k + 1) / (double)i - (double)x / (double)y);\n                if (err < best)\n                {\n                    best = err;\n                    ans.num = k + 1;\n                    ans.den = i;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        reduce(ans);\n        cout << ans.num << \"/\" << ans.den << endl;\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef reduce(f):\n    num, den = f\n    greater = num if num > den else den\n    smaller = den if num > den else num\n    if smaller == 0:\n        greater = 1\n        return (num // greater, den // greater)\n    while smaller != 0:\n        remainder = greater % smaller\n        greater = smaller\n        smaller = remainder\n    return (num // greater, den // greater)\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().strip().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    for i in range(0, len(data), 3):\n        x = int(data[i])\n        y = int(data[i+1])\n        limit = int(data[i+2])\n        if y <= limit:\n            ans_num, ans_den = x, y\n        else:\n            best_num = None\n            best_den = None\n            best_diff = None\n            for den in range(1, limit + 1):\n                k = den * x // y\n                # candidate k/den\n                num1 = k\n                diff1 = x * den - y * num1  # non-negative\n                if best_num is None:\n                    best_num = num1\n                    best_den = den\n                    best_diff = diff1\n                else:\n                    if diff1 * best_den < best_diff * den:\n                        best_num = num1\n                        best_den = den\n                        best_diff = diff1\n                # candidate (k+1)/den\n                num2 = k + 1\n                diff2 = y * num2 - x * den  # non-negative\n                if best_num is None:\n                    best_num = num2\n                    best_den = den\n                    best_diff = diff2\n                else:\n                    if diff2 * best_den < best_diff * den:\n                        best_num = num2\n                        best_den = den\n                        best_diff = diff2\n            ans_num, ans_den = best_num, best_den\n        ans_num, ans_den = reduce((ans_num, ans_den))\n        print(f\"{ans_num}/{ans_den}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.007512413896620274, -3.099436753473128e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0003367095487192273, -3.933898824470816e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.02976059913635254, -2.3364747903542593e-05, -8.702239938429557e-06, -0.06822416931390762, -0.04869917407631874, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.009768304415047169, -3.576278118089249e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.814689989667386e-06, 0.0, -0.26674145460128784, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.3112935448589269e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -4.768360213347478e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.311301275563892e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.04945644736289978, 0.0, -7.867782187531702e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.3307284414768219, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -9.762764238985255e-05, -0.0015023384476080537, -0.0015382850542664528, -0.00026127262390218675, 0.0, -0.038044512271881104, -1.4185804502631072e-05, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.0381602980196476, -0.00033706706017255783, -0.01533